{"id":"ado_nde","lemma":"adónde","pos":"adv","rank":512,"glosses":["to where, whither, whereto"],"ipa":"/aˈdonde/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ad%C3%B3nde.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Adónde ha ido ella?","en":"Where has she gone?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449908"},{"text":"¿Adónde se ha ido?","en":"Where has she gone?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450466"},{"text":"No tengo adónde ir.","en":"I have nowhere to go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/194672"},{"text":"¿Adónde va este libro?","en":"Where does this book go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68268"},{"text":"¿Adónde vas a ir?","en":"Where will you be going?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604811"}]}